    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbafcStaffalsoa]{Staff}, Legendary (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>This staff has 8 charges.</p><p><strong>Arachnid’s Grace.</strong> While attuned to the staff, you can move up, down, and across vertical surfaces and along ceilings without using your hands. You also gain a Climb Speed equal to your Speed. You ignore movement restrictions caused by webs, and you know the location of any other creature in contact with the same web.</p><p><strong>Web.</strong> While holding the staff, you can expend 1 charge to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWeb0000000]{Web} (save DC 18) from it.</p><p><strong>Vampiric Silk.</strong> While holding the staff, you can take a Bonus Action and expend 1 charge to have a creature in the area of your @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWeb0000000]{Web} spell make a DC 18 Constitution saving throw. (The creature makes the save with Disadvantage if it has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition from the webbing.) The creature takes 4d10 Necrotic damage on a failed save or half as much damage on a successful one. Either way, you regain Hit Points equal to half the damage dealt.</p><p><strong>Regaining Charges.</strong> The staff regains 1d6 + 2 expended charges daily at dawn. If you expend the last charge, roll [[/r 1d20]]. On a 1, the staff dissolves into a swarm of harmless spiders and is destroyed.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-E4vNUz0kJBZqi5BS\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Après <em>Vampiric Silk</em>, regagnez à la main des points de vie égaux à la moitié des dégâts infligés. Le désavantage d’une créature entravée par la toile est aussi à appliquer à la main.</p></section>",
